ins and stockpiles - an exciting and immersive journey from Pit to Port. From the safety of your Industrial Mining Drone, you travel across the landscape of Western Australia in a 360 stereoscopic experience that showcases some of the largest iron ore operations in the world.", "short_description": "Where does the world\u2019s highest quality iron ore come from? Take a peek into Rio Tinto\u2019s Pilbara operations by travelling with giant haul trucks, and flying over crushers, reclaimers, trains and stockpiles - an exciting and immersive journey from Pit to Port. From the safety of your Industrial Mining Drone, you travel across the landscape of Western Australia in a 360 stereoscopic experience that showcases some of the largest iron ore operations in the world."}]}, "developer_name": "Viewport", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.viewport.com.au/privacy/RioTinoPitToPortPrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Viewport", "support_website_url": "https://viewport.com.au/", "website_url": "https://www.riotinto.com/en/careers", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "EXPLORATION", "EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3187930851485878"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "139028644366219"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "139028644366219"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1607623204, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "139028644366219"}]}, "li